--[[
AstraUI Beta 0.2
Liquid Glass Roblox UI Framework

This build is a redesigned architecture rather than a cosmetic patch.
It provides:
* layered liquid-glass surfaces
* adaptive mobile/tablet/desktop sizing
* interruptible motion primitives
* Lucide-compatible icon registration
* polished dropdown/popover behavior
* bottom notification stack
* chainable component API
* theme refresh propagation
* lifecycle-safe component destruction
]]
